<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Got Any Grapes?</title>
  <style>
    /* Scoped styles for istory.html to avoid conflicts with site CSS */
    :root{
      --bg:#0b0b0b;
      --card:#151515;
      --accent:#FFD700;
      --text:#efdecd;
      --muted:#bfaea3;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#070707,var(--bg));color:var(--text);} 
    .wrap{min-height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:32px;}
    .card{width:100%;max-width:880px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(0,0,0,0.12));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:28px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);} 
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--accent)}
    #text{font-size:1.03rem;line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0 20px;color:var(--text)}
    .choices{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .choice{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--text);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;outline:none}
    .choice:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);background:rgba(255,215,0,0.03)}
    .choice:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(255,215,0,0.12);border-color:var(--accent)}
    .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .btn:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12)}
    .progress{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
    .note{font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
    .history{font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:100%;overflow:auto;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:8px}
    @media (max-width:520px){.card{padding:18px}.choice{font-size:0.95rem}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>The Hungry Duck</h1>

  <p id="story">
    It's a beautiful sunny day, you've decided to set up a lemonade stand.
    It's sweltering out. And your ice is melting faster than customers are showing up.
    You are approached by a duck, he looks at you expectantly.
    <br><br>
    "'Hey!' The duck says. You got any grapes?”
  </p>

  <div id="choices">
    <button onclick="giveGrapes()">Give the duck grapes</button>
    <button onclick="Market()">Offer the duck directions to the supermarket</button>
    <button onclick="Lemonade()">Tell the duck you're selling lemonade</button>
  </div>

  <script>
    function giveGrapes() {
      document.getElementById("story").innerText =
        "You give the duck grapes. The duck happily eats them and follows you around forever. The end.";
      document.getElementById("choices").style.display = "none";
    }

    function Market() {
      document.getElementById("story").innerText =
        "You offer the duck some directions to the market.
         Maybe he'll find better luck there... 
         After some time, the duck waddles back with a bushel
         of grapes and a large bag of ice. He quacks thank you
         as he plops both himself and the ice bag on the grass,
         enjoying his freshly bought grapes, and the company of 
         his new friend. The end.";
      document.getElementById("choices").style.display = "none";
    }

    function Lemonade() {
      document.getElementById("story").innerText =
       "You offer some lemonade to the duck. He waddles away, continuing on 
       with his grape search. <i>What was up with that guy? 
       That jingle was good though. Then he waddled away, waddle 
       waddle...</i> The end.";
      document.getElementById("choices").style.display = "none";
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>